---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const lang = 'en';
---
<Layout
  title="The KOVE 450 Rally: why I chose it · CDM Motorsport"
  description="A true rally-raid machine, three fuel tanks and generous range: why I chose the KOVE 450 Rally for my motorcycle tours in Morocco."
  ogImage="/img/gallery/gallery-07.jpg"
  lang={lang}
>
  <section class="phero short" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery/gallery-07.jpg')">
    <div class="wrap c">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="color:#e8c9a6">Gear</div>
      <h1>KOVE 450 <em>Rally</em></h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pad">
    <div class="wrap article">
      <div class="meta reveal">Gear · 5 min read</div>
      <div class="big reveal" style="margin-bottom:24px">
        The KOVE 450 Rally:<br />why I <em>chose it</em>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <p>
          The KOVE 450 Rally has shifted a lot of things in the rally-raid world, and that's
          why I adopted it. This isn't some touring bike patched up for the desert: it's a
          real rally machine, built that way from the ground up: riding position, nav
          tower, suspension travel, toughness.
          <a href="https://kove-racing.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">KOVE Racing</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          What I love on the ground is the range. With three tanks, around thirty liters,
          she eats up long stages far from anywhere without me spending my time hunting for
          fuel. And servicing stays reasonable, which really matters when you're in the
          middle of nowhere.
          <a href="/en/moto-kove-450-rally">The full page on the bike</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          The best trade-off is that she puts a beginner at ease while still holding up for
          an experienced rider. Light, enduring, straight out of competition. For me, this
          is the ideal machine to live rally-raid without breaking the bank or sacrificing
          the ride.
        </p>

        <p style="margin-top:28px">
          Want to get your hands on one out on the pistes?
        </p>
        <a href="/en/#raids" class="btn dark" style="margin-top:14px">See my raids</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
